# The sources of the cross toolchain every C package compiles with (ADR 0075): binutils, gcc and its
# three libraries, and musl. The Linux headers come from the kernel tarball of
# image/pkgs/kernel/pin.env, which this package's Dockerfile reads too, so the image has one
# kernel version. Each digest is the one the pin's reviewer checked against the publisher:
#
# gcc 15.3.0 and binutils 2.46.1 come from sourceware.org; each digest is the SHA-512 line of the
# sha512.sum beside the release (https://sourceware.org/pub/gcc/releases/gcc-15.3.0/sha512.sum,
# https://sourceware.org/pub/binutils/releases/sha512.sum) and the SHA-256 below is that file's
# digest as measured. gmp 6.3.0, mpfr 4.2.2 and mpc 1.4.1 are GNU releases fetched from the
# mirrors.kernel.org copy of the GNU archive; each tarball's detached signature verifies against the
# GNU keyring (Niels Moller for gmp, Vincent Lefevre for mpfr, Andreas Enge for mpc), and the
# SHA-256 is the digest of the tarball that verified. musl 1.2.6 comes from musl.libc.org; its
# detached signature verifies against the musl release key (8364 8929 0BB6 B70F 99FF DA05 56BC DB59
# 3020 450F), and the SHA-256 is the digest of the tarball that verified.
# The version and the digest of each move together, in one pull request, which a reviewer checks
# against those files.
#
# musl 1.2.6 is the newest release on 2026-11-15 and carries CVE-2026-6042 (a slow GB18030 decoder in
# iconv, which no naru program calls: image/pkgs/install-bin.sh fails a program that links iconv)
# and CVE-2026-40200 (qsort, 32-bit targets only).
#
# Moved by: the PM, who reviews this pin when a stable release or a security advisory for one of the
# pinned sources is published. No bot proposes it.
BINUTILS_VERSION=2.46.1
BINUTILS_URL=https://sourceware.org/pub/binutils/releases/binutils-2.46.1.tar.xz
BINUTILS_SHA256=e127a709cba24c76de8936cb7083dd768f28cd37eb010492e2f19b71eb1294e4
GCC_VERSION=15.3.0
GCC_URL=https://sourceware.org/pub/gcc/releases/gcc-15.3.0/gcc-15.3.0.tar.xz
GCC_SHA256=fa59c1beef8995f27c4d71c1df227587189315d3e6faff1bb4306e61b0c530eb
GMP_VERSION=6.3.0
GMP_URL=https://mirrors.kernel.org/gnu/gmp/gmp-6.3.0.tar.xz
GMP_SHA256=a3c2b80201b89e68616f4ad30bc66aee4927c3ce50e33929ca819d5c43538898
MPFR_VERSION=4.2.2
MPFR_URL=https://mirrors.kernel.org/gnu/mpfr/mpfr-4.2.2.tar.xz
MPFR_SHA256=b67ba0383ef7e8a8563734e2e889ef5ec3c3b898a01d00fa0a6869ad81c6ce01
MPC_VERSION=1.4.1
MPC_URL=https://mirrors.kernel.org/gnu/mpc/mpc-1.4.1.tar.xz
MPC_SHA256=91204cd32f164bd3b7c992d4a6a8ce6519511aadab30f78b6982d0bf8d73e931
MUSL_VERSION=1.2.6
MUSL_URL=https://musl.libc.org/releases/musl-1.2.6.tar.gz
MUSL_SHA256=d585fd3b613c66151fc3249e8ed44f77020cb5e6c1e635a616d3f9f82460512a
#
# Licences (SPDX), read from the COPYING or LICENSE of each source and checked by naru-release (ADR 0076).
BINUTILS_LICENSE=GPL-3.0-or-later
GCC_LICENSE='GPL-3.0-or-later WITH GCC-exception-3.1'
GMP_LICENSE='LGPL-3.0-or-later OR GPL-2.0-or-later'
MPFR_LICENSE=LGPL-3.0-or-later
MPC_LICENSE=LGPL-3.0-or-later
MUSL_LICENSE=MIT
